  "title": "Training-Free Narrative Grounding for Long-Form Audio and Video Description",
  "summary": "StoryTeller, a training-free framework, enables narrative-aware long-form audio and video description by preserving story context and factual grounding across scenes, while integrating semantic filtering and VLM verification. It improves coherence, grounding, and comprehension over baselines.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "StoryTeller uses a training-free approach to maintain narrative memory across scenes for long-form descriptions.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The method leverages semantic filtering and VLM verification to ensure factual grounding and coherence.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Experiments show improved narrative coherence, factual grounding, and comprehension over baselines in automatic QA-based evaluations.",
      "confidence": 0.95
